---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---

<InfoLayout title="About Our Team | FreeOnlineToolkit" description="Learn about the small team behind FreeOnlineToolkit. We build free calculators and tools to help people make better financial, health, and everyday decisions.">

<div class="info-page">
  <h1>About Our Team</h1>

  <div class="team-intro">
    <p>FreeOnlineToolkit is built and maintained by a small, focused team of developers and content writers. We are not a large corporation — we are a group of people who believe that useful tools should be free, fast, and accessible to everyone.</p>
    <p>Every calculator on this site is built with careful attention to the formulas and algorithms behind it. We reference official sources — the IRS for tax calculations, the WHO for health metrics, Freddie Mac for mortgage rates — to ensure our tools reflect real-world standards.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="team-values">
    <h2>What We Believe</h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div>
        <h3>Privacy First</h3>
        <p>Every calculation runs entirely in your browser. No data is sent to our servers. Your numbers stay on your device — always.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div>
        <h3>Speed Matters</h3>
        <p>No signups, no waiting, no loading screens. Each tool loads instantly and gives you results in milliseconds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i></div>
        <h3>Accuracy Always</h3>
        <p>We use industry-standard formulas and reference official data sources. Every tool is tested against known results before publishing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div>
        <h3>Free Forever</h3>
        <p>No paywalls, no premium tiers, no hidden fees. Every tool is completely free with no usage limits.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="team-process">
    <h2>How We Build Tools</h2>
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Research</h3>
          <p>We start by understanding the real-world problem the tool solves. We review official guidelines, industry standards, and how professionals approach the calculation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>Each calculator is built using proven formulas. We document the methodology on every tool page so you can verify how the calculation works.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Test</h3>
          <p>We validate every tool against known results — bank mortgage calculators, IRS tax tables, WHO health standards — to ensure accuracy.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Update</h3>
          <p>We refresh data regularly — tax brackets annually, mortgage rates monthly, health guidelines as they change. Each tool shows its last-updated date.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="team-contact">
    <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
    <p>Have a suggestion for a new tool, found an error, or just want to say hello? We read every message.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .info-page { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .info-page h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .info-page h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .info-page p { line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .team-intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

  .values-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .value-card { padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 12px; }
  .value-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .value-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .value-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }

  .process-steps { margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .process-step { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .process-step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .step-number { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-primary); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .step-content h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .step-content p { font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0; }

  .team-contact { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; background: var(--color-surface); border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 2rem; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .values-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>

</InfoLayout>
